cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the accompanying paper."
title: "Ku-Mellin-PATP: reproducibility code"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SZabolotnii/Ku-Mellin-PATP-code-supplement"
url: "https://github.com/SZabolotnii/Ku-Mellin-PATP-code-supplement"
abstract: >-
  Verification and reproducibility code (Python) for the paper "A
  Stochastic-Polynomial Bridge: PATP Extension of Moment-Based Uncertainty
  Evaluation via the Mellin Transform". Reproduces the CAS cross-checks of the
  closed-form moment-propagation formula, the region-of-validity table, the
  closed-form Mellin-transform table, the manufactured-solution benchmark
  (Table 3 / Figure 1) and the real-data vibration-power case study
  (Table 4). The Lean 4 / Mathlib formal verification lives in the companion
  Ku_PATP repository (see README).
type: software
